{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Lost Episodes Alone you play as Michael. A 10 year old boy living in a quiet, isolated town where something sinister lurks in the shadows. When your friend Roger vanishes, you uncover a dark presence Valak has taken him. She haunts Michael and his friends Roger, Joel, Dave and Hannah in their nightmares. Try to save your friend Roger and escape the evil demon Valak.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run from Valak and survive her pursuit during nightmares</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect keys, fuses, keycards and solve puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great for horror streaming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Part 1 of 5 &quot;Short Episodes&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free DLC's upcoming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Predefined settings (No Options or Saving)\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: 30-60 Minutes\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disclaimer: Loud noises and jump scares. Best played with headset in a dark setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is developed and produced by one person.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4111550?t=1771028119","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4111550?t=1771028119","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111550/08bbfc2bb2994110cad32b16f40f056e8434de81/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771028119","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111550/08bbfc2bb2994110cad32b16f40f056e8434de81/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771028119","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Lost Episodes